raph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944340/extras/bc73bac121891e926840fb86c4a23fa9.poster.avif?t=1754420159\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944340/extras/bc73bac121891e926840fb86c4a23fa9.apng?t=1754420159\" class=\"bb_img\" width=614 height=72 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discuss the game, share record-breaking runs, and be the first to get news on the development of Unless! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOIN OUR DISCORD</strong> via the invite link in the right sidebar.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944340/extras/c559eaf8d4d961957ca15e6f4f379dbe.poster.avif?t=1754420159\" width=614 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944340/extras/c559eaf8d4d961957ca15e6f4f379dbe.webm?t=1754420159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
